        "sid": "ROM 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga eaduupcheewi, gideagasayi muuchi aba guroroodeanyu iyaamwaashchi ASEETA aba badahuuka fuga Israeli ea gideaba abeeda geelealu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geamuuwu aba badahuuka nyaawa gideaba gwandeawa badiida aba gasooda ASEETA, amadu ea meabwadana fughareeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iisidasheahiidi aba badayda doobiiwnata leabu heeda ASEETA, ak gagasa ghoang'eat daanyaawa, abeeda ea moodeagana geat doobiiwnata ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba Gristo muudeanooda deaweeda, ak abeeda siida wassean mideawa masaweega abeeda ghwanyas doobiiwnata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lealeanooda gaba buuneesean",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ghang'oar gideaba siida sina ng'asheega doabiiw aba deaweeda, gaygoobiideewa nih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea doobiiwnatida sinyasa masaweegean gwayi, adiidu giyeeni aba jeeda gurooroadaang'u, “Gajea ng'eaha gil jea gwadiyeada gawa humng'eeda?” (nih abeeda eanooga Gristo bea ng'eanyi gil) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghana gideaba “Gaygawa ng'eaha uuta ng'eanyiida?” (Nih gideaba geescheeng'na Gristo uuta ng'eanyiida heeda fuga nimeewa). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neada gwayiin? Gwayi ng'asheanda ea neekeeweey, ak gabiisa gwanda ghuutaang'u ak gabiisa gwanda gurooroadaang'u, (nea ng'asheanda ghayi bea masaweega ghayi sirukwiidi); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba, iirugu aba ghuutaang'u gideaba Yesu Ng'utamiida gil, ak gumwasi aba gurooroadaang'u gideaba ghayi gooduuna ASEETA jeeda miyeeda, gay laalaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba siida iissa ghamwas aba guroorooda ea ghwanyas doobiiwnata, ak siida gwarugu aba ghuuta ea ghwanyas lealeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi ng'ooruutka, “Manda siida wassean mwas niny ak ghabwaspwas.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba manda gidaheeleeta siida Yahudi ea dea Yunani; aba gideaba niny Ng'utamiida buuneesean gil, biissa gwandeawa baruureega aba buuneesean guuriisa niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba, “Siida wassean jea gaguurna gheawunga Ng'utamiida gay ghwalaalaan”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gajamusischeesiindaan siida mandeawana masaweega? Ak gay ghamwastaan nea mii ghwayiiy iitaanyi? Ak gay gwayiing'sheataan ii manda siida rukwiida giijasta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gay gwarukwiideaydaan siida ii miyeecheakta? Gawuurji gissing'oarda bea gideaba, “Aamiyaastaan geeshanga fuga rukwiida Giijasta miy!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ea moang'waanya buuneesean giijastida miyiin; aba gideaba gwayi Isaya, “Ng'utamiida ng'eaha siida mwas iita siitawji?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi masaweega giing'eetaanyi iing'da gil, nea iing'da gweadu ng'asheanda sirukwiida bea Gristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghanayaashti gicha, neada saawa ea mii ghwayiiy? Huumwa gil niyiiy;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
